{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46252","headline":"{巩/言}光大师草书歌 · 贯休","name":"{巩/言}光大师草书歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪压千峯横枕上，穷困虽多还激壮。\n看师逸蹟两相宜，高适歌行李白诗。\n海上惊驱山猛烧，吹断狂烟着沙草。\n江楼曾见落星石，几回试发将军炮。\n别有寒雕掠绝壁，提上玄猨更生力。\n又见吴中磨角来，舞槊盘刀初触击。\n好文天子挥宸翰，御制本多推玉案。\n晨开水殿教题壁，题罢紫衣亲宠锡。\n僧家爱诗自拘束，僧家爱画亦局促。\n唯师草圣艺偏高，一掬山泉心便足。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46252.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46252","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}